  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let $I=\\int_0^\\pi x f(\\sin x) d x=\\int_0^\\pi(\\pi-x) f(\\sin x) d x=\\pi \\int_0^\\pi f(\\sin x) d x-I \\quad(\\sin c e f(2 a-x)=f(x))$\n$\\Rightarrow I=\\pi \\int_0^{\\pi / 2} f(\\sin x) d x \\Rightarrow A=\\pi$",
    "image": null
